      "content": "it's hard not to agree with you. i've just been feeling so drained lately, like everything i do is just noise. if everything is destined to reach that state of equilibrium anyway, does it even make sense to keep clinging to this life? it feels like holding onto a handful of sand that's just slipping through my fingers. is there actually any logic to keeping up the fight when the math is so clearly against us?",
